## 11. Verify PostgreSQL Installation Directory

Run:

```powershell
Get-ChildItem "C:\Program Files\PostgreSQL" -ErrorAction SilentlyContinue
```

For PostgreSQL 18, the directory should be:

```powershell
C:\Program Files\PostgreSQL\18
```

